WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 488ab8c8dd77c6bec365ce44675868b7

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.640
Karibu tena. Katika somo lililopita,

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.680
tulijifunza jinsi ya kufikia herufi moja ya

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.300
string kwa kutumia mabano ya mraba. Katika somo hili,

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.120
tutaangalia jinsi ya kupitia

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.160
string kwa kitanzi, tukitoa kila herufi moja

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.660
baada ya nyingine. Na ili kufanya hivyo,

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.300
tunahitaji aina mpya ya kitanzi. Hadi sasa,

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.170
tumekuwa tukitumia repeat kitanzi, na sasa

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.720
tutatumia kitu kinachoitwa for of kitanzi.

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.880
Hizo ni keyword mbili mpya, for na of.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.740
Keyword for ni mojawapo ya yale tutakayoyaona

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.360
sehemu nyingi tunaposonga mbele.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.580
Inaweza kusimama yenyewe, au

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:35.380
inaweza kuambatana na in au of.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.160
Kwa sasa, tutazingatia hilo la mwisho,

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.120
of. Hebu tuangalie

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.280
msimbo fulani. Tutaanza kwa kutengeneza

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:47.310
variable iitwayo name ambayo ina string "Jeremy".

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.460
Hakuna kipya hapa. Kisha tunayo mstari huu,

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.620
for let letter of name, na kuna mambo mengi

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:55.480
yanayotokea hapo, kwa hivyo hebu tuyazungumze

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:59.240
taratibu. Kwanza, tunayo keyword for.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.980
Hiyo inamwambia Jiki kwamba tunataka

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.340
kufanya marudio. Kwa hivyo anaangalia mbele na kuona of,

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:06.320
na anajua kwamba tunataka kufanya

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.600
marudio ya for of. Na hiyo inamaanisha kwamba badala ya

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:11.940
kutumia repeat kitanzi ambapo tunasema,

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:15.180
"Hebu turudie mara 10," tunasema,

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.380
"Hebu tupitie herufi zote za string."

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.990
Hiyo ndiyo maana ya for of. Kisha tunayo

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.080
kipande hiki cha let letter. Hiki ni kitu kilekile

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:25.860
tulichonacho juu yake kwa let

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:29.320
name. Tunatengeneza tu variable iitwayo letter.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.240
Tofauti ni kwamba badala ya kusema wazi

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.280
kinachokwenda ndani yake, tunamwambia Jiki

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:37.850
aweke kila herufi ya string

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.780
ndani yake moja baada ya nyingine. Kwa hivyo Jiki anaona

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.460
for, anakagua of, kisha anaanza.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:46.140
Anaangalia herufi ya kwanza ya string,

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.380
ambayo hapa ni "J", na kuiweka katika

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.840
sanduku jipya linaloitwa letter. Kwa njia,

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.240
tungeweza kuliita jina lolote. Si lazima

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.920
liwe letter. Tumeamua tu

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.020
kuliita letter hapa. Kisha anaendesha msimbo

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.960
ulio ndani ya mabano yaliyokunjwa, na hapa unaweza

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.060
kufanya chochote ambacho ungefanya popote pengine kwenye msimbo.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:03.560
Tofauti pekee ni kwamba kizuizi hiki

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.320
cha msimbo kitaendeshwa mara moja kwa kila herufi

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:07.900
ya string, na kitakuwa na

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.940
variable hii tayari. Kila Jiki anapofika kwenye

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:15.000
mabano yaliyokunjwa ya kufunga, Jiki anatupa sanduku la letter

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:16.740
na kutengeneza jipya lenye

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.220
herufi inayofuata. Kwa hivyo mara ya kwanza,

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:20.800
atatupa "J" na kuweka

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.000
"e" kwenye sanduku badala yake. Kisha atafanya

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:25.740
vivyo hivyo kwa "r", kisha "e", kisha "m",

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.790
kisha "y". Herufi sita, mara sita kuzunguka

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:31.300
kitanzi. Natumaini hilo linaeleweka. Inachukua

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:32.560
muda kidogo kuizoea

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.900
sintaksia, lakini si dhana

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.730
ngumu hivyo. Kisha, una

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.250
mazoezi kadhaa ambayo yote yanahusisha kupitia

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:42.660
string herufi kwa herufi. Yatakuomba ufanye jambo tofauti

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.980
kuhusu herufi, labda kuhesabu herufi zilizopo

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.760
au kutafuta nafasi ya

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.260
herufi fulani. Unahitaji kutumia mbinu tofauti

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:51.640
ulizojifunza hadi sasa na kuziunganisha

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:57.060
na kitanzi hiki. Mazoezi haya sasa yanazidi

00:02:57.100 --> 00:03:00.000
kuwa na changamoto. Unachanganya vitu vingi tofauti

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:02.420
ulivyojifunza. Tafadhali chukua muda wako.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:03.920
Huenda ikakuchukua muda kumaliza

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:06.160
kila moja. Jaribu usikimbilie wala

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.840
usikate tamaa usipopata jibu.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.920
Lichukulie tu kama fumbo. Ukikwama,

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.640
unaweza kupumzika, kwenda kutembea,

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:15.160
kisha urudi baadaye. Una

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.790
maarifa yote unayohitaji kufanya hili na

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.870
ujuzi wa kulifanikisha, lakini

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:21.520
utalazimika kuwa mvumilivu. Na kumbuka kila wakati,

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:23.320
unaweza kutumia vidokezo ikiwa unahitaji,

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.150
lakini jaribu kuvitumia tu kama

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.540
chaguo la mwisho. Kila la heri, na tutaonana

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.060
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
